{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24746","headline":"醉中见微之旧卷有感 · 白居易","name":"醉中见微之旧卷有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝何事一沾襟，检得君诗醉後吟。\n老泪交流风病眼，春笺摇动酒杯心。\n银钩尘覆年年暗，玉树泥埋日日深。\n闻道墓松高一丈，更无消息到如今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}